# Language stats: Corros is the project. The Rust under src/ is only the
# bootstrap seed that boots the Corros-written compiler (the same way rustc's
# first compiler was written in OCaml, and CPython's core is C). Mark it
# generated so GitHub's language bar reflects the actual language — Corros.
# Requires the "Corros" entry in github-linguist/linguist (PR #8130) so .cor
# files are detected; until that merges, .cor files are invisible to the bar.
*.rs   linguist-generated=true
Cargo.toml   linguist-generated=true
Cargo.lock   linguist-generated=true
